{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overview:<br>This is an incredibly boring driving adventure game where players control a small car that falls from the sky and navigates the roads. Your task is to make the right choices, avoid driving into a dead end, and reach the destination.\u21b3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core gameplay includes:\u21b3</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Driving challenge: Choose the right path to ensure you can keep moving forward.\u21b3</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever-changing roads: The paths change, but not too often.\u21b3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:\u21b3</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Especially boring, just like your damn life.\u21b3</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Highly tests patience\u2014have you really thought about why you're moving forward?\u21b3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goal: Find the correct path and avoid reaching a dead end. But, can you actually achieve this goal?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Most Boring People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480360/200d296025cc18649bd8e366426cb3d3d6ab6f38.jpg"},{"name":"The Most Most Boring people","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480360/76b89a7f1d184b9443ae02c4a025179dbd4c1daa.jpg"},{"name":"First Taste Of The Forbidden Fruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480360/0a501699ec0726726fc79154b4792e6af9b7987a.jpg"},{"name":"No Complaints, No Regrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480360/76e00c563e3d0ba6b061ef9f7c9f2cacb4af9296.jpg"},{"name":"Lying Flat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3480360/28cd0896dfe73300c0ab105e54111f267627dac0.jpg"},{"name":"Set Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam